# Orquestração global

- **Framework:** `~/.cursor/orchestration` (ou `ORCHESTRATION_HOME`)
- **Config do projeto:** `.cursor/orchestration.config.json`
- **CLI:** `npm run orchestration:global -- <subcomando>` ou `orchestration <subcomando>` (com PATH)
- **Instalar framework (uma vez):** `npm run orchestration:install-global`
- **Novo projeto:** `npm run orchestration:global -- init`

## Subcomandos comuns

```bash
npm run orchestration:global -- compliance --pre-work --issue ANX-N --persona orchestrator
npm run orchestration:global -- chat --new-only
npm run orchestration:global -- workflow -- monitor --level C
```

Docs: `GLOBAL-INSTALL.md` em `ORCHESTRATION_HOME`
